# Data Hub Ledger Directory

This directory stores the ledger for Data Hub operations, including:

- External search queries and results
- API discovery operations  
- Sandbox execution logs
- Performance metrics

## Contents

- `search_queries.jsonl` - Query history with anonymized hashes
- `api_discoveries.jsonl` - OpenAPI endpoint discovery logs
- `sandbox_executions.jsonl` - Code execution audit trail
- `performance_metrics.jsonl` - Response times and cache hit rates

## Privacy

All user queries are stored as SHA-256 hashes to protect privacy while enabling analytics.
